        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c11b4f7-51ee-423b-a1c1-39b97604415b).Image",
        "Description": "Alright, gamers! It&apos;s time to get ready for the upcoming baseball game. Too bad all of the fields are unavailable. But we need to practice! Where else can we practice for the game? Oh! I know! Let&apos;s go to that big high-end hospital! A perfect substitute! And it looks like they were kind enough to provide you a uniform and a baseball bat to practice with. Just make sure you land on every base and then head straight back to home. (Note: Max level mastery highly recommended)",
